<title>FINLAND: Finnish T-bill auction raises FIM 890 million.</title>
<headline>Finnish T-bill auction raises FIM 890 million.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the State Treasury Office's T-Bill auction May 27 versus May 20  SUVK :</p>
<p>			THIS AUCTION/PREVIOUS AUCTION</p>
<p> Maturity, days   200/207		351/358</p>
<p> Avge yld, pct   3.14/3.13	    3.33/3.31</p>
<p> Highest yld     3.14/3.14	    3.34/3.31</p>
<p> Lowest  yld     3.12/3.12	    3.33/3.31</p>
<p> Amount,FIM million   670/170		220/70</p>
<p> Bids, FIM million  1,000/472		620/382</p>
<p>After today's auction, the outstanding amount of treasury bills is 45,164 million markka, the STO said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@Reuters.fi</p>
</text>
